Subject: [PATCH 2/2] test: functional: add test for temporary device lifetime

Add a test where an unpaired peer connects over BR/EDR, disconnects and
keeps advertising with Flags 0x18. No report claims the peer is
discoverable, so the device object is expected to be removed after
TemporaryTimeout.

The test fails as long as btd_adapter_device_found() restarts the
temporary timer for such reports.
